      "en": "Then he brought me out into the outer court, the way toward the north. Then he brought me into the room that was opposite the separate place, and which was opposite the building toward the north.",
      "ko": "그가 나를 데리고 밖으로 나가 북편 뜰로 가서 두 방에 이르니 그 두 방의 하나는 골방 앞 뜰을 향하였고 하나는 북편 건물을 향하였는데",
      "source_text_hash": "6d361a89f0f536df45ec9269341e99649f6853b143891877c10dd687a1c2576d",
      "translation_text_hash": "bcfcd38da5fba60792dde18ce9066c8927bfda96269763dba800ff74d4143a50",
