      "en": "Before the rooms was a walk of ten cubits’ width inward, a way of one cubit; and their doors were toward the north.",
      "ko": "그 두 방 사이에 통한 길이 있어 광이 십척이요 장이 일백척이며 그 문들은 북을 향하였으며",
      "source_text_hash": "42f7b22506ab3647a7286700cde55d0f99c0ac7fa6048f23e1ed08605df240d5",
      "translation_text_hash": "72cb66d03450249c35e70334c26a8e634e2b14ccf4bbfc199fa5cb91edbef5a0",
