      "en": "For they were in three stories, and they didn’t have pillars as the pillars of the courts. Therefore the uppermost was set back more than the lowest and the middle from the ground.",
      "ko": "그 방이 삼층이라도 뜰의 기둥 같은 기둥이 없으므로 그 상층이 하층과 중층보다 더욱 좁아짐이더라",
      "source_text_hash": "591d222a8754ea98af87b28dd731839e992b00ec09d976ca8db0769eff8d9553",
      "translation_text_hash": "e57095af5c3989032d9360ebf24bd12360faa420df04b5156dbb75eed6188d9c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
