      "en": "From under these rooms was the entry on the east side, as one goes into them from the outer court.",
      "ko": "이 방들 아래에 동편에서 들어가는 통행구가 있으니 곧 바깥 뜰에서 들어가는 통행구더라",
      "source_text_hash": "9d7fb82f7b0bf3b380ff82cbc69b7c0413ba90ea503055f1b46072a888c1fe37",
      "translation_text_hash": "4c60492ca0831e97b270f692038df1532af968e2a0f97b6ce708d2e16e054810",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
